        "sentences": [
            [
                "Hey guys, this is Aria!",
                "嘿大家好，我是阿莉亚！"
            ],
            [
                "Welcome back to my channel!",
                "欢迎回到我的频道！"
            ],
            [
                "Today is my husband Tommy's birthday.",
                "今天是我丈夫汤米的生日。"
            ],
            [
                "We'll have a small dinner party at our house.",
                "我们将在家里举办一个小型晚宴。"
            ],
            [
                "Follow me and see how it goes!",
                "跟着我来看看进展如何！"
            ],
            [
                "Now we're in the backyard.",
                "现在我们在后院。"
            ],
            [
                "The weather is nice.",
                "天气很好。"
            ],
            [
                "We're going to eat outside.",
                "我们要在户外用餐。"
            ],
            [
                "We set the table earlier in the morning.",
                "我们在早上早些时候摆好了餐桌。"
            ],
            [
                "We got these beautiful bowls, plates and cups from abroad.",
                "我们从国外买来了这些漂亮的碗、盘子和杯子。"
            ],
            [
                "This set of silverware, which includes knives, forks and spoons, is a gift from a friend.",
                "这套包括刀、叉和勺的银餐具是一位朋友送的礼物。"
            ],
            [
                "We only take them out for special days, like today.",
                "我们只在特殊的日子才拿出来，比如今天。"
            ],
            [
                "We invited several friends a few weeks ago.",
                "几周前我们邀请了几位朋友。"
            ],
            [
                "They were told to bring one of their favourite desserts.",
                "他们被告知要带上他们最喜欢的甜点之一。"
            ],
            [
                "This means we're going to have some really delicious home-made sweet snacks!",
                "这意味着我们要享用一些真正美味的自制甜点小吃了！"
            ],
            [
                "Patrick, Emily and Anne will bring some banana cakes, mango rice, butter biscuits and fruit sugars.",
                "帕特里克、艾米莉和安妮会带一些香蕉蛋糕、芒果饭、黄油饼干和水果糖。"
            ],
            [
                "I love their desserts so much.",
                "我太喜欢他们的甜点了。"
            ],
            [
                "I never have enough.",
                "我总是吃不够。"
            ],
            [
                "Look, who is in the kitchen?",
                "看，谁在厨房里？"
            ],
            [
                "Tommy's mum just finished baking a lovely birthday cake.",
                "汤米的妈妈刚刚烤好了一个可爱的生日蛋糕。"
            ],
            [
                "She is now preparing for today's barbecue.",
                "她现在正在准备今天的烧烤。"
            ],
            [
                "As you see, the bottom of the cake is decorated with lots of cream.",
                "如你所见，蛋糕底部装饰着很多奶油。"
            ],
            [
                "On top, there're some strawberry slices and chocolate bars.",
                "上面有一些草莓片和巧克力棒。"
            ],
            [
                "We hope Tommy will like it.",
                "我们希望汤米会喜欢。"
            ],
            [
                "Now I'm going to pick some apples and lemons from our backyard.",
                "现在我要去后院摘一些苹果和柠檬。"
            ],
            [
                "It would be great to make some fresh drinks like juice, lemonade, cocktails and fruit tea.",
                "制作一些新鲜的饮料如果汁、柠檬水、鸡尾酒和果茶会很棒。"
            ],
            [
                "We can serve our thirsty guests with these drinks.",
                "我们可以用这些饮料招待我们口渴的客人。"
            ],
            [
                "It's already three o'clock.",
                "已经三点了。"
            ],
            [
                "I have to start preparing for the cooking.",
                "我得开始准备做饭了。"
            ],
            [
                "See you later!",
                "待会儿见！"
            ]
        ]
    },
